  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc4/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review: ir.py:393-396 and to_dict still emit files_skipped as an int on every run. Since 6e7e48bf42 (INV-virik), failed_files and warnings are emitted only when non-empty, so the 'failed_files=[] and warnings=[] on all runs' wording is stale. On the packages/ self-analysis, 99/99 ARs have an int files_skipped and 2 have a failed_files list. The type asymmetry remains, now with presence asymmetry on top. MECHANISM: AR per-pass problem channels use different container shapes (scalar count vs optional list). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-sizih."  # b6d8
